  "title": "Adapting to heat stress in Antwerp (Belgium) based on detailed thermal mapping",
  "summary": "The city of Antwerp, facing increasing heat stress, has adopted adaptation measures at the city-wide, local and citizen scale. This includes the development of a heat forecast and warning system, which has raised awareness at the political level. However, challenges remain for communication and technical integration. The city of Antwerp, in order to better understand the problem of heat stress, commissioned the research organization VITO to map the current and future temperatures and thermal comfort in the city.",
